    "detailed_description": "Experience the ultimate thrill of becoming a Jump Hero in this hyper-addictive arcade game! The goal is simple: survive as long as possible, beat your high score, and dominate the leaderboard! Play solo or compete with friends with local co-op mode!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EASY TO LEARN</h2><br>Our easy-to-learn gameplay puts you in control of your hero on an 8x8 grid, with new obstacles randomly appearing to keep you on your toes. But beware - this game is highly addictive!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARD TO MASTER</h2><br>Compete with others for first place in leaderboards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENT MODES</h2><br>Jump Heroes will be expanded with new modes after the release, challenging you and requiring a new approach to reach the highest scores.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><br>Personalize your gaming experience with 22 unique heroes to choose from at launch, with even more coming in future updates.<br>Unlock them all and show your style!<br><br>Get ready to jump to new heights and become a legend in the Jump Heroes.",
